      "id": "hackernews-2026-07-30-ron-gilbert-started-production-on-thimbleweed-park-2",
      "title": "Ron Gilbert started production on Thimbleweed Park 2",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://www.grumpygamer.com/twp2_announce/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49107246\nPoints: 92\n# Comments: 34",
      "body": "I have good news and bad news.\nThe good news is that we just started production on Thimbleweed Park 2, due out in early 2028.\nWe will self-publish with the help of a private investor.\nMark Ferrari, Gary Winnick, David Fox, Octavi Navarro, Robert Megone, and others from the original team will be back!\nI’ll be starting up a Thimbleweed Park 2 dev blog like we did for Thimbleweed Park and posting regularly to keep everyone up to date.\nThere is no bad news, it’s all good news.\nP.S. Thimbleweed Park 1 is on sale on Steam, Switch, iOS and Google. But I suspect all my readers already own it.\nP.P.S Steam doesn’t show it yet, but there will be Mac, Windows and Linux.\nP.P.P.S There will be a GOG version.",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
