      "publishedAt": "2026-07-28T19:06:33.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/waymo-fleet-getty.jpg?resize=1200,801",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/28/waymo-robotaxi-operators-face-fresh-scrutiny-over-emergency-response-failures/",
