      "id": "bbc-2026-07-26-andy-burnham-rules-out-early-election-in-exclusive-bbc-inter",
      "title": "Andy Burnham rules out early election in exclusive BBC interview",
      "summary": "The new prime minister told Laura Kuenssberg that people \"voted for a manifesto\" that he would honour, when pressed on whether there will be an early general election.",
      "body": "In an exclusive interview with the BBC's Laura Kuenssberg, Andy Burnham explicitly dismissed the idea of an early general election, saying \"I'm going to rule it out... I don't think people want it.\"Explaining his decision, the new prime minister suggested the majority of the electorate \"voted for a manifesto\" in the last election, and vowed he would \"honour that manifesto\" with the support of parliamentary colleagues.Burnham went on to say, \"I just think what I most need to do is get Britain focused on getting the country back where it should be, getting it working.\"Andy Burnham: The Laura Kuenssberg Interview will be available across BBC News on Sunday and the interview will be shown in full on Panorama on BBC One on Monday at 20:00 BST.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "world",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-26T05:00:56.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/branded_news/580c/live/d4fb7700-885a-11f1-b2ab-0dd01740f9f6.jpg",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c935kzyq6r4o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
